        },
        {
          "text": " Koar da emoŋ ka emerekek, asubanit naka ainakineta nuka ainapakin, nakerai kanuka ituŋa; kijaikis odwe luka Aaron ŋes aokot, kobwatanak otem owaitin kere, ",
